  <running_head>ADVERBIORUM</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">[<i>Observatio.</i> 1. Quædam Adverbia</l>
    <l n="2">Loci &amp; Temporis, etiam cum Dativo</l>
    <l n="3">construuntur, ut:</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>τῷ τεθνηκότι πολλησίον.ὁ πολλοῖς ἐπὶ ὕστερον.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">2. πάλιν, segregandi, quemvis ca-</l>
    <l n="6">sum admittit; pro ratione Verbi, cui</l>
    <l n="7">adjungitur, ut:</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>Πεῖσον ἐσω ἄλλο φάρμακον, πάλιν λόγος.ὁ Ἡμῖς, πάλιν τῆς σοφοῖς λέγων.μηδὲν εἰδέναι, πάλιν αὐτὸ τοῦτο.]</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" type="heading" level="2" para="true">IIII.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Congregandi Adverbia, Dativis</l>
    <l n="11">junguntur, ut:</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>ἅμα τῇ ἡμέρᾳ.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>ὁμῦ τοῖς ἄλλοις.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" type="heading" level="2" para="true">V.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Iurandi Adverbia, cum Accusativo</l>
    <l n="16">construuntur, ut:</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>νὴ τὸν Θεόν.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>μὰ Δία.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Regulæ Rectionis Adverbio-</l>
    <l n="20" type="heading" level="2">rum cum Verbis.</l>
    <l n="21" type="heading" level="2" para="true">I.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Adverbia Temporis, &amp; Interrogan-</l>
    <l n="23">di, sententiam certam cum Indi-</l>
    <l n="24">cativo</l>
  </main_text>
